    Kim.AUI -> Kim.UAS.UiApi 'Connect to the notifications stream' {
        notes'''
          #### Connect to the notifications stream
          >[!NOTE]
          >personal-admin.test.ts > RemoveAdmin demotes the only admin — the owner remains (no last-admin lockout)

          >[!IMPORTANT]
