          >[!TIP]
          > Phase 5: the LAST-ADMIN guard is SKIPPED in the personal context
          > (the owner remains the operator — org contexts keep the guard);
          > activity-first step 6: validation reads + activity write only
        '''
    }
    Kim.UAS.UiApi -> Kim.Registry 'find Social Agent Registration [Agent]' {
