          > (`registry/kim/social-agent/plp3a3/` — the Phase 5 seed) delivers
          > the PATCH `Update` removing the admin marker — Alice holds NO
          > channel on Kim's ACTIVITY registry, so this is how she learns
        '''
    }
    Alice.UAS.WebhookReceiver -> Alice.Registry 'PUT delegatedGrantsUpdated activity [Activity]' {
        notes'''
          #### PUT delegatedGrantsUpdated activity [Activity]
          >[!NOTE]
