        '''
    }
    Kim.UAS.WebhookReceiver -> Kim.AUI 'stream activity events (pending → done)' {
        notes'''
          #### stream activity events (pending - done)
          >[!NOTE]
          >personal-admin.test.ts > RemoveAdmin demotes the only admin — the owner remains (no last-admin lockout)

