          Authorization: DPoP eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs…
          ```

          ```http
          HTTP/1.1 200 OK
          Link: <https://registry/yoyo/>;
                rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/interop#hasRegistrySet"
          ```
        '''
    }
    Dan.UAS.UiApi -> YoYo.Registry 'PUT invitationCreated activity [Activity]' {
        notes'''
          #### PUT invitationCreated activity [Activity]
          >[!NOTE]
          >invitation.test.ts > admin

          >[!IMPORTANT]
          > Auth: Solid OIDC access token as `dan`

          >[!TIP]
          > activity-first (step 1): the RPC writes the activity to the ORG's
          > Activity Registry (actor = the org) and returns a pending ack

          ```http
          PUT https://registry/yoyo/activity/2e9c5aa1-7d3b-4f8b-a6c4-9d0e1f2a3b4c
          Authorization: DPoP eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs…
          ```

          ```json
          {
            "@context": ["in reality payload uses Expanded JSON-LD"],
            "id": "https://registry/yoyo/activity/2e9c5aa1-7d3b-4f8b-a6c4-9d0e1f2a3b4c",
            "type": ["Activity", "InvitationCreated", "as:Create"],
            "as:actor": "https://id/yoyo",
            "as:object": {
              "id": "https://registry/yoyo/invitation/a9a00485-cdb7-4db8-b3af-a8f8dc55fd0b",
              "type": ["SocialAgentInvitation"],
              "label": "Kim",
              "note": "Some note"
            },
            "interop:createdAt": "2024-01-01T10:00:00.000Z"
          }
          ```
          ---

          ```http
          HTTP/1.1 201 Created
          ```
        '''
    }
    parallel {
      Dan.UAS.UiApi -> Dan.AUI 'OK (pending)' {
          notes'''
            #### OK (pending)
            >[!NOTE]
            >invitation.test.ts > admin

            ```http
            HTTP/1.1 200 OK
            ```

            ```json
            {
              "_tag": "Success",
              "value": {
                "accepted": true,
                "id": "https://registry/yoyo/invitation/a9a00485-cdb7-4db8-b3af-a8f8dc55fd0b",
                "label": "Kim",
                "note": "Some note"
              }
            }
            ```
            ### Checks

            #### Compare with request
            * `label`
            * `note`

            #### String matching
            * `id` - `https://registry/yoyo/invitation`
            * no `capabilityUrl` in the response
          '''
      }
      YoYo.Registry -> YoYo.UAS.WebhookReceiver 'notify Add activity (subscription webhook) [Activity]' {
