                interop:hasCapabilityUrl
                  <https://auth/.sai/invitations/aHR0cHM6Ly9pZC95b3lv.b5ad0d73-fdb6-4375-b439-a7988b87d47f> .
              ?s ?p ?o
            }
          }
          ```
        '''
    }
