    Alice.UAS.Temporal -> Alice.Registry '(activity) load role before-image + PUT role [Role]' {
        notes'''
          #### (activity) load role before-image + PUT role [Role]
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > update role chums remove kim add bob

          >[!IMPORTANT]
          > Auth: Solid OIDC access token as `alice`

          >[!TIP]
          > `updateRoleInRegistry`: find-first by the stable role id
          > (idempotent under retries/reconcile); the affected diff (old vs
          > new members) is derived from the before-image

          ```http
          PUT https://registry/alice/role/xcoq3l
          Authorization: DPoP eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs…
