    }
    Alice.UAS.Temporal -> Alice.Registry 'find role usage [Authorization]' {
        notes'''
          #### find role usage [Authorization]
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > update role chums remove kim add bob

          >[!TIP]
          > registry-plane SPARQL scan (docs/sparql.md): usedAsGrantee +
          > dataOwner authorizations of the role
