          {
            "type": "activity",
            "activity": {
              "id": "https://registry/alice/activity/2e9c5aa1-7d3b-4f8b-a6c4-9d0e1f2a3b4c",
              "type": ["Activity", "RoleMembershipChanged", "as:Update"],
              "actor": "https://id/alice",
              "object": {
                "id": "https://registry/alice/role/xcoq3l",
                "type": ["Role"],
                "label": "Chums",
                "members": ["https://id/bob"]
              },
              "createdAt": "2026-09-01T01:50:31.328Z",
              "status": "done"
            }
          }
          ```
        '''
    }
  }

  dynamic view role-deletion {
    title: 'Roles / Bob deletes the Whiz role'

    include Bob
    include Bob.AUI, Bob.UAS, Bob.UAS.UiApi, Bob.UAS.Temporal, Bob.UAS.WebhookReceiver, Bob.Registry

    style Bob {
      color: green
    }

    Bob.AUI -> Bob.UAS.UiApi 'Connect to the notifications stream' {
        notes'''
          #### Connect to the notifications stream
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

          >[!IMPORTANT]
          > Auth: CSS cookie session as `bob`

          >[!TIP]
          > response stays alive for streaming

          ```http
          GET https://auth/.sai/events
          Accept: application/x-ndjson
          ```
        '''
    }
    Bob.AUI -> Bob.UAS.UiApi 'POST (RPC) deleteRole' {
        notes'''
          #### POST (RPC) deleteRole
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

          >[!IMPORTANT]
          > Auth: CSS cookie session as `bob`

          >[!TIP]
          > activity-first (step 3): the RPC only writes the activity — the
          > role is DELETEd by the workflow; a read-side guard loads the role
          > (the snapshot source)

          ```http
          POST https://auth/.sai/api
          Cookie: css-account=339642f3-f3ee-42e5-85b9-4b1ab6b27ddc
          ```

          ```json
          [
            {
              "request": {
                "_tag": "DeleteRole",
                "id": "https://registry/bob/role/v7emok",
                "context": "https://id/bob"
              }
            }
          ]
          ```
        '''
    }
    Bob.UAS.UiApi -> Bob.Registry 'GET role — guard read + snapshot source [Role]' {
        notes'''
          #### GET role - guard read + snapshot source [Role]
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

          >[!IMPORTANT]
          > Auth: Solid OIDC access token as `bob`

          >[!TIP]
          > the role is still alive here — the read is both the existence
          > guard (a missing role errors the RPC) and the write-time
          > snapshot: its label + members embed as the activity's as:object
          > (the UI only sent the role id)

          ```http
          GET https://registry/bob/role/v7emok
          Authorization: DPoP eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs…
          ```
          ---

          ```http
          HTTP/1.1 200 OK
          ```

          ```json
          {
            "@context": ["in reality payload uses Expanded JSON-LD"],
            "id": "https://registry/bob/role/v7emok",
            "type": ["Role"],
            "label": "Whiz",
            "members": ["https://id/dan"]
          }
          ```
        '''
    }
    Bob.UAS.UiApi -> Bob.Registry 'PUT roleDeleted activity [Activity]' {
        notes'''
          #### PUT roleDeleted activity [Activity]
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

          >[!IMPORTANT]
          > Auth: Solid OIDC access token as `bob`

          >[!TIP]
          > `target` dropped — the deleted role's id rides `object.id`; the
          > object is the role-to-be-deleted (real-id embedded projection of
          > the FULL RoleData — the write-time snapshot from the guard read)

          ```http
          PUT https://registry/bob/activity/2e9c5aa1-7d3b-4f8b-a6c4-9d0e1f2a3b4c
          Authorization: DPoP eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs…
          ```

          ```json
          {
            "@context": ["in reality payload uses Expanded JSON-LD"],
            "id": "https://registry/bob/activity/2e9c5aa1-7d3b-4f8b-a6c4-9d0e1f2a3b4c",
            "type": ["Activity", "RoleDeleted"],
            "as:actor": "https://id/bob",
            "as:object": {
              "id": "https://registry/bob/role/v7emok",
              "type": ["Role"],
              "label": "Whiz",
              "members": ["https://id/dan"]
            },
            "interop:createdAt": "2024-01-01T10:00:00.000Z"
          }
          ```
          ---

          ```http
          HTTP/1.1 201 Created
          ```
        '''
    }
    parallel {
      Bob.Registry -> Bob.UAS.UiApi 'pending ack (deleted role id + activityId)' {
          notes'''
            #### pending ack (deleted role id + activityId)
            >[!NOTE]
            >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

            ```http
            HTTP/1.1 200 OK
            ```

            ```json
            {
              "_tag": "Success",
              "value": {
                "id": "https://registry/bob/role/v7emok",
                "activityId": "https://registry/bob/activity/2e9c5aa1-7d3b-4f8b-a6c4-9d0e1f2a3b4c"
              }
            }
            ```
            ### Checks

            #### String matching
            * `id` - `https://registry/bob/role`
            * `activityId` - `https://registry/bob/activity`
            * no synchronous DELETE — the role is deleted by the workflow
          '''
      }
      Bob.Registry -> Bob.UAS.WebhookReceiver 'notify Add activity (subscription webhook) [Activity]' {
          notes'''
            #### notify Add activity (subscription webhook) [Activity]
            >[!NOTE]
            >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

            ```json
            {
              "@context": [
                "https://www.w3.org/ns/activitystreams",
                "https://www.w3.org/ns/solid/notifications-context/v1"
              ],
              "id": "urn:uuid:5f3d8b21-9c4e-4a7d-b2e6-1a0c8f3d7e9b",
              "type": "Add",
              "object": "https://registry/bob/activity/2e9c5aa1-7d3b-4f8b-a6c4-9d0e1f2a3b4c",
              "target": "https://registry/bob/activity/",
              "published": "2026-09-01T01:50:31.328Z"
            }
            ```
          '''
      }
    }
    Bob.UAS.WebhookReceiver -> Bob.UAS.Temporal 'start processRoleDeletion workflow' {
        notes'''
          #### start processRoleDeletion workflow
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

          >[!TIP]
          >gRPC

          >[!TIP]
          > the decoded object passes verbatim (the workflow's data arg); the
          > triggering activity rides as a typed ref — traceable completion

          ```json
          [
            "https://id/bob",
            {
              "id": "https://registry/bob/role/v7emok",
              "type": ["Role"],
              "label": "Whiz",
              "members": ["https://id/dan"]
            },
            {
              "id": "https://registry/bob/activity/2e9c5aa1-7d3b-4f8b-a6c4-9d0e1f2a3b4c",
              "type": ["Activity", "RoleDeleted"]
            }
          ]
          ```
        '''
    }
    Bob.UAS.Temporal -> Bob.UAS.Temporal '(workflow) run processRoleDeletion' {
        notes'''
          #### (workflow) run processRoleDeletion
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

          >[!TIP]
          > the usage scan runs BEFORE the deletions — the matched
          > authorization ids and the dataOwner-grantees must be captured
          > while the authorizations still exist
        '''
    }
    Bob.UAS.Temporal -> Bob.Registry 'find role usage [Authorization]' {
        notes'''
          #### find role usage [Authorization]
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

          >[!TIP]
          > registry-plane SPARQL scan (docs/sparql.md): usedAsGrantee +
          > dataOwner authorizations of the role; the affected members ride
          > the embedded object (the write-time snapshot — unrecoverable
          > from the store after the role + its role-grantee authorizations
          > are gone, e.g. on a retry)
        '''
    }
    Bob.UAS.Temporal -> Bob.Registry 'DELETE matched authorizations [Authorization]' {
        notes'''
          #### (activity) DELETE matched authorizations [Authorization]
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

          >[!IMPORTANT]
          > Auth: Solid OIDC access token as `bob`

          ```http
          DELETE https://registry/bob/authorization/ab7c9d
          Authorization: DPoP eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs…
          ```
          ---

          ```http
          HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
          ```
        '''
    }
    Bob.UAS.Temporal -> Bob.Registry '(activity) delete role [Role]' {
        notes'''
          #### (activity) delete role [Role]
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

          >[!IMPORTANT]
          > Auth: Solid OIDC access token as `bob`

          >[!TIP]
          > `deleteRoleFromRegistry`: find-first by the stable role id — a
          > retry after a crash between the DELETE and the completion sees
          > the role already gone and skips (404-tolerant, idempotent); the
          > role must be gone before the regeneration so the membership
          > re-reads see it removed

          ```http
          DELETE https://registry/bob/role/v7emok
          Authorization: DPoP eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs…
          ```
          ---

          ```http
          HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
          ```
        '''
    }
    parallel {
      Bob.UAS.Temporal -> Bob.UAS.Temporal '(child workflows) start create grants for each affected agent' {
          notes'''
            #### (child workflows) start create grants for each affected agent
            >[!NOTE]
            >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

            >[!TIP]
            > affected = the role's members from the embedded object (role
            > used as grantee) + grantees of dataOwner authorizations (from
            > the usage scan)
          '''
      }
      Bob.UAS.Temporal -> Bob.UAS.Temporal 'run createGrantsForAgent'
      Bob.UAS.Temporal -> Bob.Registry '(activity) replace grants + registration [Grant]' {
          notes'''
            #### (activity) replace grants + registration [Grant]
            >[!NOTE]
            >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

            >[!IMPORTANT]
            > Auth: Solid OIDC access token as `bob`

            >[!TIP]
            > self-contained regeneration: the agent's authorizations are
            > gone (role + authorizations deleted) → the deny path — grants
            > cleared, registration `hasDataGrant` rewritten to []

            ```http
            PATCH https://registry/bob/social-agent/dan/
            Authorization: DPoP eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs…
            ```

            ```json
            {
              "@context": ["in reality payload uses Expanded JSON-LD"],
              "id": "https://registry/bob/social-agent/dan/",
              "type": ["SocialAgentRegistration"],
              "interop:hasDataGrant": []
            }
            ```
            ---

            ```http
            HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
            ```
          '''
      }
      Bob.Registry -> Bob.UAS.Temporal 'OK'
    }
    Bob.UAS.Temporal -> Bob.Registry 'PUT activityCompleted [Activity]' {
        notes'''
          #### (activity) PUT activityCompleted [Activity]
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

          >[!TIP]
          > single completion after all branches succeed (children never
          > mark done)

          ```http
          PUT https://registry/bob/activity/c6f2a0b9-4d5e-4a7f-9b3c-8e1d0f2a5c6d
          Authorization: DPoP eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs…
          ```

          ```json
          {
            "@context": ["in reality payload uses Expanded JSON-LD"],
            "id": "https://registry/bob/activity/c6f2a0b9-4d5e-4a7f-9b3c-8e1d0f2a5c6d",
            "type": ["Activity", "ActivityCompleted"],
            "as:target": "https://registry/bob/activity/2e9c5aa1-7d3b-4f8b-a6c4-9d0e1f2a3b4c",
            "interop:createdAt": "2024-01-01T10:00:02.000Z"
          }
          ```
          ---

          ```http
          HTTP/1.1 201 Created
          ```
        '''
    }
    Bob.Registry -> Bob.UAS.WebhookReceiver 'notify Add activity (subscription webhook) [Activity]' {
        notes'''
          #### notify Add activity (subscription webhook) [Activity]
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role
        '''
    }
    Bob.UAS.WebhookReceiver -> Bob.AUI 'done' {
        notes'''
          #### done
          >[!NOTE]
          >roles.test.ts > delete grantee role

          >[!TIP]
          > NDJSON - formatted here for readability

          ```json
          {
            "type": "activity",
            "activity": {
              "id": "https://registry/bob/activity/2e9c5aa1-7d3b-4f8b-a6c4-9d0e1f2a3b4c",
              "type": ["Activity", "RoleDeleted"],
              "actor": "https://id/bob",
              "object": {
                "id": "https://registry/bob/role/v7emok",
                "type": ["Role"],
                "label": "Whiz",
                "members": ["https://id/dan"]
              },
              "createdAt": "2026-09-01T01:50:31.328Z",
              "status": "done"
            }
          }
          ```

          >[!TIP]
          > the RoleDeleted done-row refreshes the context's agent + role
          > lists (events.ts) — the deleted role disappears, and dan's
          > revoked grant flips his access flag
        '''
    }
  }
}

views "Authorization" {
  dynamic view share-resource {
      title: 'Share resource'

      include Alice, App, Peers
      include App.UI, Alice.AUI, Alice.UAS, Alice.UAS.UiApi, Alice.UAS.Temporal, Alice.UAS.WebhookReceiver, Alice.Registry, Alice.Data, Peers.UAS

      style Alice {
        color: green
      }

      style App {
        color: gray
      }

      style Peers.UAS {
        multiple: true
      }

      App.UI -> Alice.AUI 'redirect' {
          notes'''
            #### redirect
            >[!NOTE]
            >share.test.ts > shares a data instance with a social agent

            >[!TIP]
            > indicates the `resource` on the share window
          '''
      }
      Alice.AUI -> Alice.UAS.UiApi 'POST (RPC) getResource' {
          notes'''
            #### POST (RPC) getResource
            >[!NOTE]
            >share.test.ts > Alice loads the indicated resource

            >[!IMPORTANT]
            > Auth: CSS cookie session as `alice`

            ```http
            POST https://auth/.sai/api
            Cookie: css-account=8187358a-2072-4dce-9c76-24caffcc84a4
            ```
          '''
      }
      Alice.UAS.UiApi -> Alice.Data 'GET indicated resource [Data]' {
          notes'''
            #### GET indicated resource [Data]
            >[!NOTE]
            >share.test.ts > the resource document at the indicated id

            >[!IMPORTANT]
            > Auth: Solid OIDC access token as `alice`

            ```http
            GET https://data/alice-home/x1n3cm/n8k3wp
            Authorization: DPoP eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs…
            ```
            ---

            ```http
            HTTP/1.1 200 OK
            Content-Type: application/ld+json
            ```
          '''
      }
      Alice.UAS.UiApi -> Alice.Registry 'find social agents with access [Authorization][Agent]' {
          notes'''
            #### find social agents with access [Authorization][Agent]
            >[!NOTE]
            >share.test.ts > the share window filters the agent list

            >[!IMPORTANT]
            > Auth: Solid OIDC access token as `alice`

            >[!TIP]
            > SPARQL over the authorization registry — scope-matched against the
            > indicated resource (`matchesScope`)
            ```
          '''
      }
      Alice.UAS.UiApi -> Alice.AUI 'OK relevant data' {
          notes'''
            #### OK relevant data
            >[!NOTE]
            >share.test.ts > the share window renders (agents with access folded
            > into the response)
          '''
      }
      Alice.AUI -> Alice.UAS.UiApi 'POST (RPC) shareResource' {
          notes'''
            #### POST (RPC) shareResource
            >[!NOTE]
            >share.test.ts > shares a data instance with a social agent

            >[!IMPORTANT]
            > Auth: CSS cookie session as `alice`

            >[!TIP]
            > activity-first: the RPC builds the DataAuthorizations-to-be
            > (`buildShareDataAuthorizations` — owner excluded, already-have-access
            > filtered, ids pre-minted) and writes ONE activity for ALL grantees —
            > no synchronous mutation, no per-grantee loop

            ```http
            POST https://auth/.sai/api
            Cookie: css-account=8187358a-2072-4dce-9c76-24caffcc84a4
            ```

            ```json
            [
              {
                "request": {
                  "_tag": "ShareResource",
                  "authorization": {
                    "applicationId": "https://data/test-client/public/id",
                    "resource": "https://data/alice-home/x1n3cm/n8k3wp",
                    "agents": ["https://id/kim", "https://id/bob"],
                    "accessMode": ["http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Read"],
                    "children": []
                  },
                  "context": "https://id/alice"
                }
              }
            ]
            ```
          '''
      }
      Alice.UAS.UiApi -> Alice.Registry 'PUT authorizationGranted activity [Activity]' {
          notes'''
            #### PUT authorizationGranted activity [Activity]
            >[!NOTE]
            >share.test.ts > ONE activity carries ALL grantees' DAs (the workflow
            > groups by grantee). Diagram shows two grantees (kim, bob) to
            > illustrate the fan-out; share.test.ts exercises a single grantee.

            >[!IMPORTANT]
            > Auth: Solid OIDC access token as `alice`

            >[!TIP]
            > each `as:object` member is a term-covered DataAuthorization-to-be at
            > its PRE-MINTED id — grantee rides the POJO (parents and children)

            ```http
            PUT https://registry/alice/activity/2e9d5b31-6b7a-4f0e-9c3d-8a1b2c4d5e6f
            Authorization: DPoP eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs…
            ```

            ```json
            {
              "@context": ["in reality payload uses Expanded JSON-LD"],
              "id": "https://registry/alice/activity/2e9d5b31-6b7a-4f0e-9c3d-8a1b2c4d5e6f",
              "type": ["Activity", "AuthorizationGranted"],
              "as:actor": "https://id/alice",
              "as:target": "https://registry/alice/authorization/",
              "as:object": [
                {
                  "id": "https://registry/alice/authorization/4f8a3b2c-1d9e-4c7a-8b6f-3e2d1c0a9b7c",
                  "type": ["http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/interop#DataAuthorization"],
                  "grantee": "https://id/kim",
                  "grantedBy": "https://id/alice",
                  "registeredShapeTree": "https://data/shapetrees/trees/Project",
                  "scopeOfAuthorization": "http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/interop#SelectedFromRegistry",
                  "dataOwner": "https://id/alice",
                  "hasDataRegistration": "https://data/alice-home/",
                  "accessMode": ["http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Read"],
                  "hasDataInstance": ["https://data/alice-home/x1n3cm/n8k3wp"]
                },
                {
                  "id": "https://registry/alice/authorization/9b6d4e5f-2a3b-4c8d-9e0f-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
                  "type": ["http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/interop#DataAuthorization"],
                  "grantee": "https://id/bob",
                  "grantedBy": "https://id/alice",
                  "registeredShapeTree": "https://data/shapetrees/trees/Project",
                  "scopeOfAuthorization": "http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/interop#SelectedFromRegistry",
                  "dataOwner": "https://id/alice",
                  "hasDataRegistration": "https://data/alice-home/",
                  "accessMode": ["http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Read"],
                  "hasDataInstance": ["https://data/alice-home/x1n3cm/n8k3wp"]
                }
              ],
              "interop:createdAt": "2024-01-01T10:00:00.000Z"
            }
            ```
            ---

            ```http
            HTTP/1.1 201 Created
            ```
          '''
      }
      Alice.UAS.UiApi -> Alice.AUI 'OK confirmation' {
          notes'''
            #### OK confirmation
            >[!NOTE]
            >share.test.ts > the callback endpoint in the payload

            ```http
            HTTP/1.1 200 OK
            ```

            ```json
            {
              "_tag": "Success",
              "value": {
                "callbackEndpoint": "https://test-client"
              }
            }
            ```
          '''
      }
      Alice.AUI -> App.UI 'redirect back' {
          notes'''
            #### redirect back
            >[!NOTE]
            >share.test.ts > the app receives the callback
          '''
      }
      Alice.Registry -> Alice.UAS.WebhookReceiver 'notify Add activity (subscription webhook) [Activity]' {
          notes'''
            #### notify Add activity (subscription webhook) [Activity]
            >[!NOTE]
            >share.test.ts > ONE webhook delivery — the single activity

            >[!IMPORTANT]
            > Auth: Capability URL

            ```json
            {
              "@context": [
                "https://www.w3.org/ns/activitystreams",
                "https://www.w3.org/ns/solid/notifications-context/v1"
              ],
              "id": "urn:uuid:5f3d8b21-9c4e-4a7d-b2e6-1a0c8f3d7e9b",
              "type": "Add",
              "object": "https://registry/alice/activity/2e9d5b31-6b7a-4f0e-9c3d-8a1b2c4d5e6f",
              "target": "https://registry/alice/activity/",
              "published": "2024-01-01T10:00:00.328Z"
            }
            ```
          '''
      }
      Alice.UAS.WebhookReceiver -> Alice.UAS.Temporal 'start processAuthorizationGranted workflow' {
          notes'''
            #### start processAuthorizationGranted workflow
            >[!NOTE]
            >share.test.ts > dedicated parent workflow — one per activity

            >[!TIP]
            > gRPC

            ```json
            [
              { "id": "https://id/alice", "type": ["http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/interop#SocialAgent"] },
              [
                {
                  "id": "https://registry/alice/authorization/4f8a3b2c-1d9e-4c7a-8b6f-3e2d1c0a9b7c",
                  "type": ["http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/interop#DataAuthorization"],
                  "grantee": "https://id/kim",
                  "grantedBy": "https://id/alice",
                  "registeredShapeTree": "https://data/shapetrees/trees/Project",
                  "scopeOfAuthorization": "http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/interop#SelectedFromRegistry",
                  "dataOwner": "https://id/alice",
                  "hasDataRegistration": "https://data/alice-home/",
                  "accessMode": ["http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Read"],
                  "hasDataInstance": ["https://data/alice-home/x1n3cm/n8k3wp"]
                },
                {
                  "id": "https://registry/alice/authorization/9b6d4e5f-2a3b-4c8d-9e0f-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
                  "type": ["http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/interop#DataAuthorization"],
                  "grantee": "https://id/bob",
                  "grantedBy": "https://id/alice",
                  "registeredShapeTree": "https://data/shapetrees/trees/Project",
                  "scopeOfAuthorization": "http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/interop#SelectedFromRegistry",
                  "dataOwner": "https://id/alice",
                  "hasDataRegistration": "https://data/alice-home/",
                  "accessMode": ["http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#Read"],
                  "hasDataInstance": ["https://data/alice-home/x1n3cm/n8k3wp"]
                }
              ],
              {
                "id": "https://registry/alice/activity/2e9d5b31-6b7a-4f0e-9c3d-8a1b2c4d5e6f",
                "type": ["Activity", "AuthorizationGranted"]
              }
            ]
            ```
          '''
      }
      Alice.UAS.Temporal -> Alice.UAS.Temporal '(workflow) run processAuthorizationGranted' {
          notes'''
            #### (workflow) run processAuthorizationGranted
            >[!NOTE]
            >share.test.ts > groups the embedded DAs by grantee — one child per
            > agent (always fan out); children never mark done
          '''
      }
      parallel {
        loop 'grantees.each' {
          Alice.UAS.Temporal -> Alice.UAS.Temporal '(child workflows) start processGranteeAuthorization per grantee'
          Alice.UAS.Temporal -> Alice.UAS.Temporal '(workflow) run processGranteeAuthorization'
          Alice.UAS.Temporal -> Alice.Registry '(activity) PUT DataAuthorizations at the pre-minted ids [Authorization]' {
              notes'''
                #### (activity) PUT DataAuthorizations at the pre-minted ids [Authorization]
                >[!NOTE]
