                      "accessMode": ["acl:Read", "acl:Create", "acl:Update", "acl:Delete"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
          ```
          ---

          >[!TIP]
          > the group content mirrors the seeded access needs (`environments/data/registry.trig` #need-group-pm) — Project + inherited Task only in this view's payload; FRESH urn:uuid ids; FIRST PASS carries NO description literals (en/es descriptions follow up)
